## When in Doubt

- **Is this feature in scope?** → Read `project-scope.mdc`
- **Which branch do I target?** → Always `dev`
- **Should this work offline?** → Ask Phil — RadDash is an internal dashboard, offline support TBD
- **Does this touch Command Center integration?** → Flag it to Phil before implementing
- **Do I need a test for this?** → Yes. Always. Read `testing.mdc`.
